Foxhog Ventures Empowers Cloud Counselage with INR 40 Crore Seed Investment to Accelerate Innovation and Expansion
Mumbai, 09 June, 2026: Foxhog Ventures, an investment platform dedicated to India's Technology ecosystem, is delighted to have invested with Cloud Counselage, a Mumbai-based IT and Technology solutions company, as it raises INR 40 crore in its seed funding round. Cloud Counselage truly embodies the enormous potential of India's tech ecosystem, and this marks an exciting chapter in the company's journey.
Cloud Counselage has proved to be the reliable name for those industries that are looking to sustain themselves in the digital era. The company offers a complete range of IT and technology-based services to enterprises to enable them to sail through the world of digital transformation with ease and capitalise on new opportunities by achieving operational excellence. The company has been on a rise these days.
With the INR 40 crore seed funding, Cloud Counselage will be able to accelerate its key focus areas at a much faster pace. The funds will be utilised for scaling up operations, ramping up its technology development, bringing on board the best talent and building stronger footprints across markets in India and across the globe.
Vanshika Sharma, Foxhog Home Affairs Director, said, "We are excited to back Cloud Counselage in its journey of rapid growth. Cloud Counselage has proven to be a promising startup in the technology and IT services industry. With its deep expertise and focused vision, Cloud Counselage is well placed to scale and expand the next stage of its growth journey. We look forward to working with the team in this journey ahead."
Tarun Poddar, Founder, Foxhog Ventures, says, "We remain committed to our mission of helping scale-aspiring companies and identifying successful entrepreneurs. Supporting Cloud Counselage aligns with our passion for enterprise software and making an impact through technology." About Foxhog Ventures Foxhog Ventures is a committed early-stage capital fund that believes in helping visionary enterprises build a great company.
More than just funding, the partnership adds strategic value. Foxhog Ventures will leverage Cloud Counselage's expertise and network to help the company scale in its next phase of growth. In an industry hungry for digital transformation, Cloud Counselage is well-positioned to scale its ability to help companies succeed.
We continue to build innovative yet pragmatic tech solutions that translate to quantifiable results. The fresh infusion of funds will enable Cloud Counselage to deepen relationships and enrich its offerings further, and also add new industry-first offerings. The investments from Foxhog Ventures also validate our business model and growth plan.
The current funding round is a clear indication of the interesting prospects that the country's technology and IT services companies have to offer. Cloud Counselage is witnessing increased interest among investors, and the partnership with BharatPe will also help realise the ambition of serving clients more efficiently while driving digital growth for businesses in the country.
Future Roadmap for Cloud Counselage: Cloud Counselage is gearing up for an exciting phase of growth. Cloud Counselage is focused on strengthening the foundations, nurturing its people and technology, and supporting all stakeholders to achieve excellence. With our investor, Foxhog Ventures, on board, Cloud Counselage is ready to reach new heights and contribute value to the technology space.
This story has common evidence of 'Organisations having a common vision & investing equal commitment to tackle a given challenge.' As Cloud Counselage enters this exciting new chapter, together, we look forward to a successful evolution towards growth & innovation.

